MOA Valuation Package Assembly Additional Info: 

1.   MOA Plans DO NOT have the following items in the Val Package:
a.	Audited wording
b.	SOC
c.	5500 wording
a.) Also
-   Support does not sweep MOA Plans nor do we create any Workflow Tasks for these Plans. 

2.  For Plans that have Locations 
 	When assembling these put each test with all locations. Contribution Analysis Loc 1, Contribution Analysis Loc 2, etc.
 	For Control Groups – The Tester Specialist should have already combined and put the appropriate Plan Names on the Tests.  
3. Deadlines for failed testing returns
 	MOA Plans will NOT use escalation wording for failed tests.
4. Please cross-check the following points while assembling the package:
 	Ensure all test reports are included and do not contain any SSNs.
 	Ensure all reports are arranged in the correct order as noted above
 	Verify that all reports display the correct plan name and plan number.
 	Confirm that the bookmarks are accurate for each section (except the Variance Report).
5.	Assembly Done.

